                                                "sense_id": "d21e3fbf-c4d1-3be1-a3ff-d572ccd9b8d9",
                                                "text": "The IDF spokesperson provided no comment on whether it had halted the practice, or the reported use of white phosphorus in Gaza, a densely populated area and home to more than 2 million people."
